            <div xml:id="d213">

                <pb facs="0416" n="1070" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg1070"/>

                <head>No. —.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Schuyler to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-07-23"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 23, 1875</date>.
                        (Received Sept. 7.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 140.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your dispatch No. 138,
                    instructing me to attend the international telegraphic conference held at St.
                    Petersburg, and to my dispatches Nos. 119 and 134, I have the honor to inclose
                    to you herewith my report on the conference, together with various documents
                    relating thereto.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>EUGENE SCHUYLER.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d213-a1.xml" xpointer="d213-a1"/>
            </div>
